            "description": "Subscription mode requires `priceId`. `chain` and `token` are optional overrides; if omitted they're inherited from the price. Pass `customerEmail` to find-or-create the customer, or `customerId` to reference an existing one. Metadata is propagated to the subscription record and included in lifecycle webhook events."
